---
const projectId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID || '';
const studioUrl = `https://www.sanity.io/manage/project/${projectId}/desk`;
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <title>Naturerota Blog - Admin</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #f6f6f6;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 50px auto;
      background: white;
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #123A2B;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    p {
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #123A2B;
      color: white;
      padding: 15px 30px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background: #0f2e22;
    }
    .links {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }
    .links a {
      display: block;
      color: #666;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 10px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .links a:hover {
      color: #123A2B;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>🎨 Admin - Naturerota Blog</h1>
    <p>
      Para gerenciar o conteúdo do blog, acesse o Sanity Studio na web.
      Lá você pode criar e editar posts, adicionar imagens e gerenciar autores.
    </p>
    
    <a href={studioUrl} class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Acessar Sanity Studio
    </a>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="/">← Voltar para Homepage</a>
      <a href="/blog">Ver Blog</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script define:vars={{ studioUrl }}>
    // Auto-redireciona após 3 segundos se preferir
    // setTimeout(() => {
    //   window.location.href = studioUrl;
    // }, 3000);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
